      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-02T00:59:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The term \u0027binder\u0027 here actually means the binder protocol as a local transport mechanism that the kernel binder driver implements, as opposed to the socket-based transport which isn\u0027t public yet. To the most of readers that don\u0027t know about the latter, this API name may look confusing.\n\nCan we have a better name?",
